# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# SchemeFit AI frontend (Vite) — environment template
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# The app ALWAYS calls the API at a relative path (/api/v1) so cookies stay
# first-party. There is nothing to configure here for a normal deploy:
#  - dev:  Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts)
#  - prod: the host proxies /api → the API service (see vercel.json rewrites)

# Dev-only: point the Vite proxy at a non-default backend.
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:4000
